WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.130
Week 34: Pan-Hispanic Variation and Dialect Listening. recognize major regional forms ask for clarification without judgment adapt address and vocabulary

2
00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:19.487
Mission brief. Interpret seven short regional exchanges and restate their content in neutral instructional Spanish.

3
00:00:19.487 --> 00:00:28.891
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:28.891 --> 00:00:36.672
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:36.672 --> 00:00:45.199
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:45.199 --> 00:01:15.724
Model language. Voy a interpretar siete intercambios regionales. — I am going to interpret seven regional exchanges. Cada intercambio es breve. — Each exchange is brief. Reformulo el contenido en un modelo neutral. — I reformulate the content in a neutral model. Uso el modelo instructivo del curso. — I use the course's instructional model. Así todos pueden comprender el mensaje. — This way everyone can understand the message.

7
00:01:15.724 --> 00:01:25.622
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
